MSc Artificial Intelligence at University of Saint Andrews :
Masters Dissertation : Predictives vs Reactives Paradigms in Multi-Asset Trading


Mini-Conda env : 

```
# Activate the env.
conda activate trading

# Install the requirement.txt.
pip install -r config/requirements.txt

# Save the requirements after adding a new library.
pip freeze > config/requirements.txt

```


```
 # Remove the login:~ and launching the env
 srun -p gpu-l4-n2 -q gpu-l4-n2 --gpus 1 --pty bash
conda activate trading
python src/data/fetch.py
```

